# Trivy ignore list for the security-trivy CI job (R-12).
#
# Format: one vulnerability ID per line (CVE-…, GHSA-…), optionally followed
# by `exp:YYYY-MM-DD` to expire the entry. Put the reason, the owner and the
# affected image(s) in a comment on the line above, e.g.
#   # libfoo in python:3.12-slim, not reachable from the worker; owner <name>
#   CVE-2026-00000 exp:2027-01-31
#
# Prefer rebuilding on a patched base image or bumping the dependency; an
# entry here is an accepted risk that someone signs for. Keep it short:
# every other fixable HIGH/CRITICAL finding fails CI.

