# and workflow binaries links no opa/server, opa/runtime, opa/cmd or opa/sdk
# package, and no image, compose file or chart runs `opa run --server`.
# Revisit with the OPA 1.x migration. Owner: policy service.
# Affected images: policy, workflow.
